# Nidavellir agent alignment

Before implementing features or refactors, follow **`AI_AGENT_GUIDE.md`** at the repo root.

## Always

1. Read `AI_AGENT_GUIDE.md` alignment checklist for the kind of change (screen / data / API / payments / native).
2. Respect live switch in `apps/mobile/src/config/appConfig.ts` (`dataSource`, `allowMockFallback`, `apiBaseUrl`).
3. No Expo. No committed secrets. New Architecture stays off unless the user explicitly re-enables it.
4. Razorpay: branch on `intent.demoMode` (demo sheet + `/demo-complete` vs native SDK + `/confirm`).
5. Orders/payments in API mode must use repository `critical` paths (no silent fake paid orders).
6. New screens → `navigation/types.ts` + `RootNavigator.tsx` + entry points.
7. Forms → shared validation patterns (`lib/addressValidation.ts` for addresses).
8. Update `PROJECT_INSIGHTS.md` / `AI_AGENT_GUIDE.md` when live-switch or payment behavior changes.

